{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01095",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.56,
      "end_seconds": 5.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Hello, you know, doctor. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.98,
      "end_seconds": 10.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.78,
      "end_seconds": 29.71,
      "duration_seconds": 16.93,
      "text": "Yeah, it's swollen ankles. I don't know what's causing it. My neighbour said I should get it looked at. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.22,
      "end_seconds": 33.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.0,
      "end_seconds": 35.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Probably three weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.24,
      "end_seconds": 45.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.29,
      "end_seconds": 53.91,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "a seven out of ten, I suppose. It's a couple of times a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.75,
      "end_seconds": 58.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "have you been putting on weight quickly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.69,
      "end_seconds": 61.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Yes, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.08,
      "end_seconds": 65.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Any breathlessness lying flat as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.11,
      "end_seconds": 71.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Well, yes, about the same, two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.28,
      "end_seconds": 76.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "So, is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.87,
      "end_seconds": 82.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Maybe a three out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.4,
      "end_seconds": 90.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "A few quick ones: fever or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.68,
      "end_seconds": 95.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "I haven't had fever or chest pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.23,
      "end_seconds": 100.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "A few quick ones: fainting, calf pain or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.66,
      "end_seconds": 108.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "let me think, no, I haven't had any of them"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.0,
      "end_seconds": 110.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.77,
      "end_seconds": 115.75,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.51,
      "end_seconds": 118.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.31,
      "end_seconds": 123.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.73,
      "end_seconds": 128.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.76,
      "end_seconds": 133.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.81,
      "end_seconds": 139.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Right, any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.24,
      "end_seconds": 144.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Walnuts. I come out in... well, hives."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.46,
      "end_seconds": 147.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.56,
      "end_seconds": 160.42,
      "duration_seconds": 10.86,
      "text": "Furosemide i take it it 40 milligrams, every morning. Metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day for my pressure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.72,
      "end_seconds": 164.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.59,
      "end_seconds": 184.44,
      "duration_seconds": 17.85,
      "text": "I have heart failure, for nearly five years. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. I've, I've got high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.98,
      "end_seconds": 187.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Is that everything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.81,
      "end_seconds": 198.64,
      "duration_seconds": 9.83,
      "text": "Right, so heart failure is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.69,
      "end_seconds": 214.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "okay, nearly done with the readings.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.42,
      "end_seconds": 239.6,
      "duration_seconds": 9.18,
      "text": "Okay: temp 37.0 degrees, pressure 126 over 82, SpO2 99 percent on room air, pulse is 117 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.0,
      "end_seconds": 245.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.79,
      "end_seconds": 247.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.23,
      "end_seconds": 258.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Your neck veins look raised."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.72,
      "end_seconds": 262.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Okay, raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.95,
      "end_seconds": 274.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "There is pitting swelling up to the shins on both sides."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.02,
      "end_seconds": 281.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "you can sit up now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.08,
      "end_seconds": 304.2,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. This is probably fluid overload from heart failure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.6,
      "end_seconds": 311.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.46,
      "end_seconds": 323.56,
      "duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like fluid overload from heart failure, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.54,
      "end_seconds": 368.6,
      "duration_seconds": 31.06,
      "text": "I want blood tests done, that's for fluid overload. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. I want a heart ultrasound done, that's for suspected heart failure. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. Weigh yourself every morning and tell us if you gain more than two kilos in three days. Let's get you seen by the community nursing team, I'll arrange the letter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.54,
      "end_seconds": 374.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Sure, you know, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 375.01,
      "end_seconds": 396.79,
      "duration_seconds": 21.78,
      "text": "If it hasn't settled next month, we'd think about a chest X-ray, but not now. One warning sign to remember: you become more breathless or gain weight quickly. In that case don't wait. I'd like to see you again after the heart scan. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 398.71,
      "end_seconds": 402.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "uh, thank you, doctor, goodbye"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 402.59,
      "end_seconds": 404.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}